  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disposal of Obsolete Pesticides ? Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Long term Objective:
Improved environmental management and sustainable development ? quality of life, sustainable agriculture ? for food security and the protection of human health. 
Specific Objective:
Thirty five tonnes of obsolete pesticides and associated wastes have been safeguarded and disposed of in an environmentally sound manner and national capacities are strengthened to prevent the future accumulation of obsolete pesticides.</narrative>
